#Post-RPSBLAST Processing Utility

#Input data file:	arch/tie2.asn
#Output data file:	(stdout)
#Annotation data at:	data
#E-Value cutoff:	0.01
#Redundancy:	Concise
#Data requested:	Domain hits and site annotations
#Output format -- tab-delimited table
#Show superfamilies: NO
#DATA
#SESSION	<session-ordinal>	<program>	<database>	<score-matrix>	<evalue-threshold>
#QUERY	<query-id>	<seq-type>	<seq-length>	<definition-line>
#DOMAINS
#<session-ordinal>	<query-id[readingframe]>	<hit-type>	<PSSM-ID>	<from>	<to>	<E-Value>	<bitscore>	<accession>	<short-name>	<incomplete>	<superfamily PSSM-ID>
#more such lines......
#ENDDOMAINS
#SITES
#<session-ordinal>	<query-id[readingframe]>	<annot-type>	<title>	<residue(coordinates)>	<complete-size>	<mapped-size>	<source-domain>
#more such lines......
#ENDSITES
#MOTIFS
#<session-ordinal>	<query-id[readingframe]>	<title>	<from>	<to>	<source-domain>
#more such lines......
#ENDMOTIFS
#ENDQUERY	<query-id>
#more query sections..
#ENDSESSION	<session-ordinal>
#more session sections..
#ENDDATA
#=====================================================================
DATA
SESSION	1	blastp	2.17.0+	Cdd	BLOSUM62	2e-06
QUERY	Query_1	Peptide	430	NP_415929.1 phosphatase domain-containing protein YnbD [Escherichia coli str. K-12 substr. MG1655]
DOMAINS
1	Query_1	Specific	350376	295	429	3.06789e-55	179.393	cd14527	DSP_bac	-	531719
1	Query_1	Specific	239481	47	197	9.57818e-33	122.036	cd03386	PAP2_Aur1_like	-	529117
ENDDOMAINS
SITES
1	Query_1	Specific	catalytic site	C376,R382	2	2	350376
1	Query_1	Specific	active site	Y98,R106,S132,L133,H134,T168,H174,D178	8	8	239481
ENDSITES
ENDQUERY
ENDSESSION	1
ENDDATA
